  "title": "xml: register root cdata fields with a .cdata suffix",
  "description": "That keeps the CDATA FT_STRING and the entire object FT_PROTOCOL\nfrom having the same abbreviation, but also keeps all the other\nfields having the correct hierarchy under the protocol prefix.\n(Possibly all the CDATA fields should have a suffix to distinguish\nthem from the related fields.)\n\nChange bcace72563fe36cb5da8f4e5e6344864d6516c37 (which has not\nbeen backported, so the protocol name reversion only affects the\ncurrent master.)",
